# PM dashboard row todos — user free text

`dashboard/pm-dashboard-row-todos.json` holds **your** scratch notes per app row on the PM
dashboard. Each `rows["App Name"]` value is free-form Markdown in your voice — not
agent-generated status.

## Do not overwrite

When syncing TLDRs, refreshing marketing/build notes, or updating limb
`the-conversation/` files:

- **Never replace** an existing `rows[...]` string unless you **explicitly** asked to
  change that row's free text.
- **Do not** substitute structured agent summaries (health, ranked to-dos, PH
  checklists) into this file — that belongs in `apps.json` **`tldr`** and limb
  conversation markdown.

## Where agent updates go instead

| What | Where |
|------|--------|
| Dashboard TLDR column | `apps.json` → `apps[].tldr` |
| Build ship state | `the-conversation/build/status.md` |
| Marketing ASO / PH | `the-conversation/marketing/*.md` |
| Your scratch notes | `pm-dashboard-row-todos.json` — **hands off** |

## If you need to touch row todos

- **Append** only when the user asks to add something to their row notes.
- **Edit in place** only the fragment the user quoted or named.
- When unsure, update `tldr` / conversation files and **leave row todos unchanged**.
